[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術部のみんなも快く協力してくれて\n助かったでござるな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's a relief the alchemy club was so willing to help us out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃんたちに任せておけば安心だよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We can always count on Resna and the others!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、腕は確かなようだしね。\nこの間のライブの時も……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, they clearly know what they're doing. Even back at that live show..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういえば、あの時の礼もまだきちんとできていない\nというのに……また借りができてしまったな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Speaking of which, we never properly thanked them for that either... and now we owe them even more."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その借りは、本番で返すのがプロというものですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A true professional repays their debts on stage."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "社長！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "President!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この学園という舞台で、完璧なパフォーマンスを\n披露し、宴を大いに盛り上げる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We will take this academy as our stage, deliver a flawless performance, and bring the whole celebration to life."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それこそがアイドルとして為すべき「礼」でしょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That is the only \"thank you\" worthy of an idol."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……御意",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...As you say."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういえば、結局本番には間に合いそうなわけ？\nそれがダメなら借りを返すとか以前の問題だけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the way, are we actually going to make it in time? Because if not, talk of repaying debts is a bit premature."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、それは……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-well...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "無事、運営からも正式にゴーサインが出ましたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The organizers have officially given us the green light."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "三人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "三人"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "人も、モノも、各所の協力のおかげで\nなんとか目途が立ちました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks to everyone's cooperation, we have the people and the resources we need to see this through."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "学園の生徒たちはもちろん、\n『ＱＥジーンズ』の宣伝も効果てきめんでしたわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The academy students were a tremendous help, and the QE Jeans promotion worked like a charm as well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それなら、あとは本番で結果を出すだけね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then all that's left is to deliver when it counts."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちなみに、本番のタイムテーブルも確定しました。\nあなたたちの順番は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Speaking of which, the performance schedule has been finalized. As for your slot..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "１番目。すなわちトップバッターですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're first. Opening act."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "嘘！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're kidding!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "公募枠の拙者たちが！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Us?! The open audition group?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "会場を０から盛り上げなくてはなりませんから、\n若く勢いのあるグループが選ばれることが多いのです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Someone has to warm up the crowd from scratch, and it tends to fall to younger groups with plenty of energy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふん、上等じゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fine by me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "盛り上げるための演出も考えなくてはならんな。\nレスナ殿にも相談に乗っていただこう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll need to think carefully about how to get the crowd going. We should ask Resna for her input as well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん、ワクワクしてきた！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh, now I'm getting excited!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うむ。我ら『Ｃｕｔｉｅ☆ＡｎｉｍａＬ』の晴れ舞台、\n必ずやみんなの期待に応えてみせようぞ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. This is Cutie☆AnimalL's moment to shine. Let us rise to meet everyone's expectations!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おー！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "三人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "三人"
        }
      }
    }
  },
